            <p>Clean It With Fire was a group project I developed with 3 other students in our Advanced Game Design and Development course in Unity. This was hands down one of the best collaborative experiences I've ever had. The team was incredible, and we built something we're all genuinely proud of. The game received raving reviews from both our peers and instructors, and we're excited to continue developing it further over the summer.</p>
